  "hasDescription": [
    {
      "@id": "https://data.datatourisme.fr/08aa52db-2ce0-3496-8489-0573e9b82229",
      "dc:description": {
        "de": [
          "Yogakurse (alle Stufen), Meditation, Klangbäder in Gruppen und einzeln\nAyurvedische Kochworkshops, Essenslieferungen, ayurvedische Massagen, Vorträge, Musik, Mantras, etc.\n\"Kümmere dich um deinen Körper, damit deine Seele Lust hat, darin zu bleiben\" Indisches Sprichwort"
        ],
        "en": [
          "Yoga classes (all levels), meditation, group and individual sound baths\nAyurvedic cooking workshops, meal delivery, ayurvedic massages, conferences, music, mantras, etc.\n\"Take care of your body so that your soul wants to stay there\" Indian proverb"
        ],
        "it": [
          "Corsi di yoga (tutti i livelli), meditazione, bagni sonori di gruppo e individuali\nLaboratori di cucina ayurvedica, consegna di pasti, massaggi ayurvedici, conferenze, musica, mantra, ecc.\n\"Prenditi cura del tuo corpo in modo che la tua anima voglia restarci\" Proverbio indiano"
        ],
        "fr": [
          "Cours de yoga (tous niveaux), méditation, bains sonores collectifs et en individuel. \nAteliers cuisine ayurvédique, livraison de repas, massages ayurvédiques, conférences, musique, mantras, etc.\n« Prends soin de ton corps pour que ton âme ait envie d’y rester \" Proverbe Indien"
        ],
        "nl": [
          "Yogalessen (alle niveaus), meditatie, groeps- en individuele klankbaden\nAyurvedische kookworkshops, maaltijdbezorging, ayurvedische massages, lezingen, muziek, mantra's, enz.\n\"Zorg voor je lichaam, zodat je ziel er zal willen blijven\" Indisch spreekwoord"
        ],
        "es": [
          "Clases de yoga (todos los niveles), meditación, baños de sonido grupales e individuales\nTalleres de cocina ayurvédica, reparto de comidas, masajes ayurvédicos, conferencias, música, mantras, etc.\n\"Cuida tu cuerpo para que tu alma quiera quedarse allí\" Proverbio indio"
        ]
      },
      "@type": [
        "Description"
      ],
